  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Intercambios, det latinamerikanska konsortiet f&#xF6;r genderbaserat v&#xE5;ld och h&#xE4;lsa arbetar genom Program for Appropriate Technology in Health (PATH) med att st&#xE4;rka h&#xE4;lsosektorns kapacitet att hantera genderbaserat v&#xE5;ld i Latinamerika. f&#xF6;rst&#xE4;rka de offentliga och privata h&#xE4;lsosystemens kapacitet att hantera genderbaserat v&#xE5;ld i Latinamerika. S&#xE4;rskilt fokus p&#xE5; Nicaragua, Honduras, Guatemala.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intercambios, the Latin American Consortium for gender-based violence and health works through Program for Appropriate Technology in Health (PATH)to strenghten the private and public health sectors capacity to address gender-based violence in Latin America. Special focus on Nicaragua, Honduras and Guatemala.</narrative>
  </description>
